        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 4, 2007</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 11, 2007</p><p>ORD C34041 Section 1 (Recodification)</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=10.34.150">Section 10.34.150</a> REPEALED (Issuance)<br />
